Some important Documnet attribute.
 document.URL : Actual URL of the website
 document.body: This is everything inside of the body
 document.head: this is everything inside of the head of the page
 document.links: links anchored in the page

 Some methods for grabbing elements from the DOM 
  document.getElementById(): Returns the element with the id 
  document.getElementByClassName(): Returns list of all elements belonging to a class 
  document.getElementByTagName():
  document.querySelector(): Returns the first object matching the CSS style selector 
  document.querySelectorAll(): Returns all objects matching the CSS style selector 

  EXAMPLE:

  if we want to grab the first h1 and change it color to red we do this.

  var h1Selector = document.querySelector("h1");
  h1Selector.style.color = "red";